{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日熱傳一段 5 秒短片，直擊一輛私家車在隧道內行駛期間，男司機疑似熟睡，雙手甚至完全放開軚盤，車輛全程僅由身旁的副駕乘客以「單手扶軚」操控。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-12h27m05s609.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026CmhkEQDLlE1789360383.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-12h27m05s609.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段所見，當時正值深夜凌晨，私家車在隧道內持續行駛，惟坐在司機位上的男子全程合上雙眼，任由雙手垂下未有握緊軚盤。坐在副駕駛座的人非但沒有叫醒司機，反而一邊持手機錄影、一邊伸出單手扶着軚盤操控車輛前進，更在片中寫下「真係瞓㗎喎」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-12h27m08s238.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20260iJL6RdOEc1789360393.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-12h27m08s238.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">短短 5 秒的片段隨即在各大社交平台瘋傳，引來網民一面倒「鬧爆」涉事者罔顧他人安全。有網民斥責「黐線，咁都得？」、「眼瞓就唔好揸車啦」，亦有大量網民質疑這是一場危險的惡作劇擺拍，怒斥：「其實就算係假嘅，只要雙手離開軚盤已經中硬，而家仲要隔離操控車輛，無論副駕有冇車牌，應該都可以兩個一齊安心上路」、「不理真與假，別人嘅危險就係佢意圖或企圖製造出來！仲要副駕揸軚 拉人啦……」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T08:21:15.779161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":376,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}